#, python-brace-format
msgid "解读 {class}`~tvm.relay.dataflow_pattern.DFPatternCallback`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:30002
msgid "`DFPatternCallbackNode` 类，它是所有数据流模式回调的基础类型。这个类继承自 `Object` 类。它包含以下成员变量："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:30004
msgid "`DFPattern pattern`：匹配的模式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:30005
msgid ""
"`PackedFunc function`：找到匹配表达式时要调用的函数。 3.` bool require_type`：在回调之前是否需要运行 "
"`InferType`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:30007
msgid "`bool rewrite_once`：是否只运行一次回调。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:30009
msgid ""
"此外，这个类还包含名为 `VisitAttrs` 的成员函数，用于访问这些属性。最后，它还定义了静态常量字符串 "
"`_type_key`，用于表示这个类的类型，以及 `TVM_DECLARE_BASE_OBJECT_INFO` 宏，用于声明这个类的信息。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:70002
msgid ""
"当在 `DFPatternCallback` 上调用 `rewrite` "
"时，后端将找到与模式匹配的部分，调用回调函数，并将匹配的表达式替换为回调返回的内容。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:70004
msgid "用户需要继承这个类并提供 `\"self.pattern\"` 来匹配。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:70006
#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:80004
msgid "参数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:70007
msgid "`require_type`: `bool` 类型，表示是否需要在回调之前运行 `InferType`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:70008
msgid "`rewrite_once`: `bool` 类型，如果为 `True`，则只运行一次回调。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:80002
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{func}`~tvm.relay.dataflow_pattern.DFPatternCallback.callback` "
"函数，用于在找到模式匹配时使用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:80005
msgid "`pre`: `tvm.relay.Expr` 类型，表示原始图中的匹配表达式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:80006
msgid "`post`: `tvm.relay.Expr` 类型，表示重写输入后的匹配表达式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:80007
msgid ""
"`node_map`: `tvm.ir.container.Map[DFPattern, List[Expr]]` "
"类型，表示模式和匹配表达式之间的映射关系。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:80009
msgid "返回值："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/relay/DFPatternCallback.ipynb:80010
msgid "`result`: `tvm.relay.Expr` 类型，表示通过回调重写匹配子图的表达式。"
msgstr ""

